{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "a732ddaee7a4ae7df3f2dab06316abf85473850d5bca02806be494ee481035f2", "ja": "迷子と歌声", "zh": "迷路的孩子与歌声", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "6aa9e4127d77ab09507d2c80cf7e34f2321bfb0a16194c1c939c012a8d298ec8", "ja": "星梨花とあずさは、自分たちがいつのまにか\nアート展示になっていた事から、迷う姿をそ\nのまま表現していいんだと悟る。ロコと海美\nも一緒になってレッスンしたいと言い出し、\nプロデューサーは安心するのだった。", "zh": "星梨花和梓发现自己不知不觉间成了艺术展品，由此领悟到，原原本本地表现出迷茫的模样也是可以的。ROCO和海美也说想一起参加练习，\n制作人这才放下心来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "92e7358826d2105c9e800121f43edc9f253882907eeab4b0bb061da4c3aacdb3", "ja": "というわけで……黙っていてすみません。\nここは美術館で、これは体験するアート展なんです。", "zh": "所以……一直瞒着你们，对不起。\n这里是美术馆，而这是一个可以亲身体验的艺术展。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_06_1001_010azu", "source_sha256": "6ba66e1b81fa5b90b578433f0bde0118ab93261ed5ff22745dc23f661453faf0", "ja": "そうだったんですね。もしかして、私と\n星梨花ちゃんが悩んでいたから……ですか？", "zh": "原来是这样啊。难道说，是因为我和\n星梨花在烦恼……才这么安排的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_06_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "cf8df1cdc9d9a3ee33e672bf4ac46d2f65de9a966aeaf2ae3a104508841362ea", "ja": "それじゃあ……今日は、わたしたちのために……？", "zh": "那么……今天是为了我们……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_06_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "859871cc01b6d7c92744eaa7bcfd8a3cdfb64b1cc319bf1636c8519f5032cf38", "ja": "うん。美術館なんて言ったら、あずささんも\nせりりんも楽しめないかもと思って……ごめんっ！", "zh": "嗯。我想着要是去美术馆的话，阿梓小姐和\n小星梨可能也会玩得不尽兴……对不起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_06_1004_025roc", "source_sha256": "67f94b814e1dcf9befb09c74de8fb9039af99c7efe5f93bf2f0562cd53190020", "ja": "ロコも、ソーリーです。ふたりには、\nリラックスしてアートを楽しんでほしくて……。", "zh": "ROCO也很抱歉。只是希望你们两个人能放松下来享受艺术……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_06_1005_025roc", "source_sha256": "3ab098613bfcf66e77bca271c8c6f5c75b634b398187d69412f70e1ec8a9946f", "ja": "アートは、緊張しながら見るものじゃなくて、\n楽しむものだって、感じてほしかったから。", "zh": "因为洛可希望你们感受到，艺术不是要紧张地去欣赏的，而是应该享受的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_06_1006_010azu", "source_sha256": "b4239b6d592b2d1ed21781f466b95441826d3d39d752d38cc43ed121efcc1777", "ja": "そういうことだったのね。\n……大丈夫よ、ふたりとも。ありがとう。", "zh": "原来是这么回事啊。\n……没关系，你们两个。谢谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_06_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "4f54aa6579c22f18bb3a2fc67daceeafbe84ad7f1fbbc6de5d58a9ea9de905fb", "ja": "わたしも、です！　だって、\nとっても楽しかったですから♪", "zh": "我也是！因为，真的非常开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_06_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "147860971047d403702f89c021df9e0087cc7a594bd2e8d247f9425483f01173", "ja": "特に、あの絵にはびっくりしました！　わたしたちが\n絵画に見えているなんて、想像もしてなかったです。", "zh": "尤其是那幅画，真的让我大吃一惊！我完全没想到，我们看起来竟然像一幅画。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_06_1009_010azu", "source_sha256": "f71ff1a0acf48a153d3340e0b7022976b0cc174c0c1e1a5b4d9a93b2ffec8e6c", "ja": "ええ、本当に。\n私達は、ただ迷っていただけなのにね。", "zh": "嗯，真的。\n明明我们只是迷路了而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_06_1010_p", "source_sha256": "0b48db84e013410b28e78c6b554e4aa513c59c82d4352929611263dbac6a7376", "ja": "そうですね。けど、迷っているふたりの姿が、\nそのまま表現……アートになっていたと思います。", "zh": "是啊。不过，我觉得，迷茫中的两个人的身影，本身就已经成为了表现……成为了艺术。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_06_1011_010azu", "source_sha256": "98280f52356d265fe29af5d866fb0a1add55b7a5bce82519ae09fc59f5465dcf", "ja": "迷っている私達そのものが、表現……。\nそれだったら……。", "zh": "迷惘的我们本身，就是一种表现……。如果是这样的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_06_1012_p", "source_sha256": "488b292e31c8d0c061b580defd85d99cbb925284e3d2b1cfc97d5380756b9a77", "ja": "あずささん？", "zh": "梓小姐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_06_1013_010azu", "source_sha256": "67516e37186fd1656902a4ef78eeb837d28e43df342fb80b6b9996540becdd93", "ja": "あのダンスを学んで楽しかった気持ちや、\nうまくいかずに悩んだりしてる気持ちを抱えて……。", "zh": "带着学习那支舞蹈时开心的心情，\n以及因为跳不好而烦恼的心情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_06_1014_010azu", "source_sha256": "616e7f76117e5ac2ef3bef02dc1dcccff4fefa5c8a8662c6c6541cd25c93f663", "ja": "自分が迷っていることそのものを、\n表現してみても……いいのかしら……？", "zh": "把自己正在迷茫这件事本身表现出来……也可以吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_06_1015_022ser", "source_sha256": "3a669e9052afe80a6cea620ef13e249b38d3664b9a3f99b1983f8e90efe53942", "ja": "あっ、そうですよね。いろんな気持ちがあって、\nどれかひとつに選べなくて、迷っていて……。", "zh": "啊，对啊。心里有各种各样的感情，\n没办法只选其中一种，所以才会感到迷茫……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_06_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "6e199d31a217e004c1841e38d46e8a201744e5297753197dd0b3c2a3918d6d63", "ja": "だったら、それをそのまま表現してみれば……\nあの、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "那就把那样的心情原原本本地表现出来……\n那个，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_06_1017_p", "source_sha256": "c0df55929c428a1f81a41b6fc838ccd38e167b32b34b47b1d20c82dc8eddd91d", "ja": "うん、問題ないと思うよ。それが、\nふたりが本当に感じた気持ちなんだから。", "zh": "嗯，我觉得没问题。因为那就是你们两个人真正感受到的心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_06_1018_029umi", "source_sha256": "69007cb01ee3b4623f2ee6fea814cb679f0818579b5a51e16443c11f04228538", "ja": "おおっ、もしかしてふたりとも、\nなんか掴めたっぽい……？", "zh": "哦哦，难道你们两个都好像抓到什么感觉了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_06_1019_025roc", "source_sha256": "935087f9403e9e808a78748690fa86512e08e72b71158bbf10c6f591ef69a8fd", "ja": "いいモチーフだと思います！　サウンドの\nニュアンスとも、フィットしてますし♪", "zh": "我觉得这是个很棒的主题！和音乐的感觉也很契合♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_06_1020_022ser", "source_sha256": "efea97c0c2a4dff16322b97f934202f89b7c4cd94b8a02ce46d40dc092f6c2aa", "ja": "あの……{$P$}さん。\nわたし、レッスンがしたいです！", "zh": "那个……{$P$}先生。\n我想去练习！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_06_1021_010azu", "source_sha256": "74f2885aa8b89ea46f5d809bd57bcc1243ebde0a3963358ce37dc227071770b0", "ja": "私もです。今気付いたこと、\nすぐにでもやっておきたくて……。", "zh": "我也是。刚刚注意到的事情，我想马上就去做……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_06_1022_029umi", "source_sha256": "14dc0e7a69c1a248bf1029b063d1370c0159f5ce6f32074eddd813c7011070ac", "ja": "うんうん！　体に叩き込むなら、\n早い方がいいと思う！", "zh": "嗯嗯！要是想把它牢牢记在身体里，我觉得还是越早开始越好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_06_1023_025roc", "source_sha256": "738e777bbaae5ade14b0b3ae2800c6105f23ee1e4761e3260dc471074ea332f0", "ja": "スタートアップしたクリエイティビティは、誰にも\n止められません♪　さあ、劇場にカムバックです！", "zh": "启动的创造力，谁也无法阻挡♪来吧，回到剧场！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_06_1024_022ser", "source_sha256": "0522f5feb089c6d0ce8700a3a14d006211d88ef37bf2eed6509b13d9b6b2b377", "ja": "おー！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_06_1025_010azu", "source_sha256": "0522f5feb089c6d0ce8700a3a14d006211d88ef37bf2eed6509b13d9b6b2b377", "ja": "おー！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_06_1026_029umi", "source_sha256": "0522f5feb089c6d0ce8700a3a14d006211d88ef37bf2eed6509b13d9b6b2b377", "ja": "おー！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_06_1027_025roc", "source_sha256": "0522f5feb089c6d0ce8700a3a14d006211d88ef37bf2eed6509b13d9b6b2b377", "ja": "おー！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_06_1028_p", "source_sha256": "87e554dd9f01e1d5c988137b871b069332668b2e1db1d2675a69451fdf494edd", "ja": "しーっ！　みんな、忘れてるけど\nここ美術館だから静かに……！", "zh": "嘘！大家都忘了，这里可是美术馆，要安静……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_06_1029_022ser", "source_sha256": "60b7091903bdadf2e36f43ac1fe8803b5de442bb1b46f23c022260b1d5bb382e", "ja": "あっ、そうでした！\nごめんなさい……えへへ。", "zh": "啊，对哦！\n对不起……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_06_1030_029umi", "source_sha256": "551ac1dede49a28beccf3f983c990bf8b6d089f223c8d6fb8b1a0ee3da80f9aa", "ja": "そういえば、本屋さんでたくさん資料を買ったけど、\nムダになっちゃったかな？", "zh": "说起来，虽然在书店买了很多资料，但会不会都白买了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_06_1031_025roc", "source_sha256": "0f7edd29c5e18afaa05a9223562bf121184ccd66e1f116c18e3d74448f40077c", "ja": "そんなことはありませんよ、ウミ！　アートブックで、\nイメージをコンストラクションできますから♪", "zh": "才不是那回事哦，海美！有了艺术书，就能构思出形象了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_06_1032_010azu", "source_sha256": "13c3e260aa81a9af6706f8f61d3e823d097968b48124e320f1c4e84a67742a47", "ja": "そうね。これからもっと学んで、身につけて……\n完成度をあげていかなくっちゃ！", "zh": "是啊。今后还得多学习，掌握更多……不断提高完成度才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
